# The onion storefront. Reached only by the pyfedi_tor container over pf_network (port 8081 is not published).
# http:// keeps Caddy from asking Let's Encrypt for a certificate it cannot get. The app trusts the marker only
# from Caddy's static IP (ONION_PROXY_IP).
http://gnzxnayrrmwidxmnmhibwzazwkssf7wkl7i2dpx2izof54yz4am5qzad.onion:8081 {
	request_header X-PieFed-Via onion
	import piefed_routes
}

